<title>HONG KONG: NAB Asia names Asia wholesale banking head.</title>
<headline>NAB Asia names Asia wholesale banking head.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank Asia said on Friday it had appointed Jeff Mitchell as general manager of National Australia Bank's global wholesale banking team in Asia.</p>
<p>The NAB Asia's regional headquarters is based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The global wholesale banking unit is responsible for developing relations with corporates, banks, fund managers and governments who require solutions in trade, capital markets, project finance, treasury and corporate lending, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
